1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,018
The trapezium rule gives point six nine seven; Simpson gives point six nine three two five.

2
00:00:07,018 --> 00:00:11,523
The true value, log two, is point six nine three one five.

3
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:15,494
Simpson's error is about a fortieth of the trapezium's.

